Mon Nov 16 17:00:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.2: install Tinta Office (ADR 0011) from Vilna's own
  Flatpak repository (flatpaks-vilna.list, ADR 0024) once the package
  carries vilna.flatpakrepo; one stamp per remote, so a remote that
  failed is tried again alone on the next boot
- Make Tinta Office the GNOME default for office documents, PDF, mail,
  calendar files and contacts (/etc/xdg/gnome-mimeapps.list)

